          "text": "የባሕርይ ፡ አምላክ ፡ እንደ ፡ ሆነ ፡ ታው",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": true
        },
        {
          "line_num": 3,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "ቀው ፡ ዘንድ ።",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": false
        },
        {
          "line_num": 4,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "⟪ወትስማዕ ፡ ቃሎ ፡ እምአፉሁ ፡⟫",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": false
        },
        {
          "line_num": 5,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "ያዘዘህን ፡ ትእዛዝ ፡ ትሰማ ፡ ዘንድ ፡ ም ፡",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": false
        },
        {
          "line_num": 6,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "፱ ፡ ፲፭ ።",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": false
        },
        {
          "line_num": 7,
          "margin_tag": "፲፭",
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "⟪፲፭ ፤ ወትኩኖ ፡ ሰማዕቶ ፡ በኀበ ፡ ኵሉ ፡ ሕዝብ ፡⟫",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": false
        },
        {
          "line_num": 8,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "⟪በዘርኢከ ፡ ወበዘሰማዕከ ፡⟫",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": false
        },
        {
          "line_num": 9,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "ባየህ ፡ በሰማህ ፡ ገንዘብ ፡ ያየኸውን ፡ የሰ",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": true
        },
        {
          "line_num": 10,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "ማኸውን ፡ በሕዝቡ ፡ ፊት ፡ ትመሰክር ፡",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": false
        },
        {
          "line_num": 11,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "ዘንድ ።",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": false
        },
        {
          "line_num": 12,
          "margin_tag": "፲፮",
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "⟪፲፮ ፤ ወይእዜኒ ፡ ዘከመ ፡ ትገብር ፡ እነግረከ ፡⟫",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": false
        },
        {
          "line_num": 13,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "አሁንም ፡ የምታደርገውን ፡ እነግርሃለሁ ።",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": false
        },
        {
          "line_num": 14,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "⟪ተንሥእ ፡ ወተጠመቅ ፡⟫",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": false
        },
        {
          "line_num": 15,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "ተነሥተህ ፡ ተጠመቅ ።",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": false
        },
        {
          "line_num": 16,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "⟪ወተኀፀብ ፡ እምኀጣውኢከ ፡⟫",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": false
        },
        {
          "line_num": 17,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "ከኃጢአትህ ፡ ተለይ ።",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": false
        },
        {
          "line_num": 18,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "⟪ወጸውዕ ፡ ስሞ ፡⟫",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": false
        },
        {
          "line_num": 19,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "በስሙ ፡ እመን ፡ ስሙን ፡ አስተምር ፡",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": false
        },
        {
          "line_num": 20,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "አለኝ ።",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": false
        },
        {
          "line_num": 21,
          "margin_tag": "፲፯",
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "⟪፲፯ ፤ ወእምዝ ፡ ገቢእየ ፡ ኢየሩሳሌም ።⟫",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": false
        },
        {
          "line_num": 22,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "ከዚህ ፡ በኋላ ፡ ወደ ፡ ኢየሩሳሌም ፡ በተመ",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": true
        },
        {
          "line_num": 23,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "ለስሁ ፡ ጊዜ ።",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": false
        },
        {
          "line_num": 24,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "⟪እንዘ ፡ እጼሊ ፡ በሌሊት ፡ በቤተ ፡ መቅደስ ፡ ደንገፅኩ ፡⟫",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": false
        },
        {
          "line_num": 25,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "ሌሊት ፡ በቤተ ፡ መቅደስ ፡ ስጸልይ ፡ ተ",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": true
        },
        {
          "line_num": 26,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "ደሞ ፡ መጣብኝ ፡ ም ፡ ፱ ፡ ፳፮ ።",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": false
        },
        {
          "line_num": 27,
          "margin_tag": "፲፰",
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "⟪፲፰ ፤ ወርኢክዎ ፡ እንዘ ፡ ይብለኒ ፡ ፃእ ፡ ፍጡነ ፡⟫",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": false
        },
        {
          "line_num": 28,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "⟪እምኢየሩሳሌም ፡⟫",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": false
        },
        {
          "line_num": 29,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "ከኢየሩሳሌም ፡ ፈጥነህ ፡ ውጣ ፡ ሲለኝ ፡",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": false
        },
        {
          "line_num": 30,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "ሰማሁ ፡",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": false
        },
        {
          "line_num": 31,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "⟪እስመ ፡ ኢይትዌከፉ ፡ ስምዐ ፡ ዚአከ ፡ በእንቲአየ ፡⟫",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": false
        },
        {
          "line_num": 32,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "ስለኔ ፡ የምትመሰክረውን ፡ ምስክርነት ፡",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": false
        },
        {
          "line_num": 33,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "አይቀበሉህምና ።",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": false
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "column_index": 2,
      "lines": [
        {
          "line_num": 1,
          "margin_tag": "፲፱",
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "⟪፲፱ ፤ ወእቤ ፡ አነ ፡ እወ ፡ እግዚኦ ፡ ለሊሆሙ ፡ የአ",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": true
        },
        {
          "line_num": 2,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "ምሩ ፡ ከመ ፡ አነ ፡ ዘእሞቅሖሙ ፡ ወእቀሥፎሙ ፡⟫",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": false
        },
        {
          "line_num": 3,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "⟪ለእለ ፡ የአምኑ ፡ ብከ ፡ በምኵራባቲሆሙ ።⟫",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": false
        },
        {
          "line_num": 4,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "ያመኑብህን ፡ ሁሉ ፡ ከምኵራባቸው ፡ እየ",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": true
        },
        {
          "line_num": 5,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "ገባሁ ፡ እያሠርሁ ፡ የምገርፋቸው ፡ እኔ ፡",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": false
        },
        {
          "line_num": 6,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "እንደ ፡ ነበርሁ ፡ ያውቃሉና ፡ አቤቱ ፡",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": false
        },
        {
          "line_num": 7,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "አዎን ፡ አይቀበሉኝም ፡ ቍ ፡ ፬ ።",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": false
        },
        {
          "line_num": 8,
          "margin_tag": "፳",
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "⟪፳ ፤ ወአመሂ ፡ ቀተልዎ ፡ ለእስጢፋኖስ ፡ ሰማዕ",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": true
        },
        {
          "line_num": 9,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "ትከ ፡ ሀሎኩ ፡ ምስሌሆሙ ፡ ህየ ፡ ኅቡረ ፡⟫",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": false
        },
        {
          "line_num": 10,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "ያንተን ፡ ነገር ፡ የሚመሰክር ፡ የሚያስተ",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": true
        },
        {
          "line_num": 11,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "ምር ፡ እስጢፋኖስንም ፡ በገደሉት ፡ ጊዜ ፡",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": false
        },
        {
          "line_num": 12,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "በነገሩ ፡ ነበርሁበት ፡",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": false
        },
        {
          "line_num": 13,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "⟪ወአዐቅብ ፡ አልባሲሆሙ ፡ ለእለ ፡ ቀተልዎ ፡⟫",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": false
        },
        {
          "line_num": 14,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "የገደሉትን ፡ ሰዎች ፡ ልብስ ፡ እጠብቅ ፡",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": false
        },
        {
          "line_num": 15,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "ነበር ፡ ም ፡ ፯ ፡ ፶፯ ። ፰ ፡ ፩ ።",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": false
        },
        {
          "line_num": 16,
          "margin_tag": "፳፩",
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "⟪፳፩ ፤ ወይቤለኒ ፡ ሑር ፡ እስመ ፡ እፌንወከ ፡ ኀበ ፡⟫",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": false
        },
        {
          "line_num": 17,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "⟪አሕዛብ ፡ እለ ፡ ርሑቃን ፡ ትስብክ ፡⟫",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": false
        },
        {
          "line_num": 18,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "ከተስፋው ፡ ርቀው ፡ የነበሩ ፡ አሕዛብን ፡",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": false
        },
        {
          "line_num": 19,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "ታስተምር ፡ ዘንድ ፡ ወደ ፡ አሕዛብ ፡ እሰ",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": true
        },
        {
          "line_num": 20,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "ድሃለሁና ፡ ሂድ ፡ አለኝ ፡",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": false
        },
        {
          "line_num": 21,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "⟪ወሰማዕክዎ ፡ ከመዝ ፡ ይቤለኒ ፡⟫",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": false
        },
        {
          "line_num": 22,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "እንዲህ ፡ ሲለኝ ፡ ሰማሁት ፡ ም ፡ ፱ ፡ ፲፭ ።",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": false
        },
        {
          "line_num": 23,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "፲፫ ፡ ፪ ።",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": false
        },
        {
          "line_num": 24,
          "margin_tag": "፳፪",
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "⟪፳፪ ፤ ወሶበ ፡ ሰምዑ ፡ ዘንተ ፡ ነገረ ፡ እምጳውሎስ ፡⟫",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": false
        },
        {
          "line_num": 25,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "⟪ከልሑ ፡ በዐቢይ ፡ ቃል ፡⟫",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": false
        },
        {
          "line_num": 26,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "ይህን ፡ ነገር ፡ በሰሙ ፡ ጊዜ ፡ በታላቅ ፡",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": false
        },
        {
          "line_num": 27,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "ቃል ፡ ጮሁ ።",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": false
        },
        {
          "line_num": 28,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "⟪ወይቤሉ ፡ አእትትዎ ፡ ለዘከመዝ ፡ እምብሔርነ ፡⟫",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": false
        },
        {
          "line_num": 29,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "ከሀገራችን ፡ አስወጡት ፡",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": false
        },
        {
          "line_num": 30,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "⟪እስመ ፡ ኢይደልዎ ፡ ይሕየው ፡⟫",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": false
        },
        {
          "line_num": 31,
